      "title": "Arlekar new full-time Governor of T.N., Sudha Yadav to take charge in Karnataka in new gubernatorial appointments",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/keralam-odisha-karnataka-uttarakhand-sikkim-tamil-nadu-get-new-governors/article71576452.ece",
      "description": "O.P. Mathur to now serve as Governor of Keralam; Braj Mohan Ram to be Governor of Odisha, Dhal Singh Bisen  Governor of Uttarakhand and former BJP general secretary Dushyant Gautam Governor of Sikkim",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-10-12T16:55:11"
    },
    {
      "title": "President appoints 4 new state governors; switches governors for 2 states",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/politics/president-appoints-4-new-state-governors-switches-governors-for-2-states-126101201291_1.html",
      "description": "Keralam Governor Rajendra Vishwanath Arlekar has been appointed as the Governor of Tamil Nadu, as part of a major gubernatorial reshuffle effected by President Droupadi Murmu on Monday.\nOm Prakash Mathur, Governor of Sikkim, will be the new Governor of Keralam in place of Arlekar, a communique issued by the Rashtrapati Bhavan said.\nDushyant Gautam has been appointed the Governor of Sikkim, it said.\nSenior BJP leader from Jharkhand, Braj Mohan Ram, has been appointed as the Governor of Odisha.\nSudha Yadav has been named the Governor of Karnataka and Dhal Singh Bisen will be Uttarakhand Governor, the communique said.\nThese appointments will take effect from the dates they will assume charge of their respective offices, it added.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-12T16:20:58"
    }
